[00:00.90][by:pinkpinprick]
[00:30.79]In my rear view mirror the sun is going down
[00:30.79]太陽在我後視鏡中落下
[00:40.66]Sinking behind bridges in the road
[00:40.66]在大道的橋後慢慢下沉
[00:50.97]And I think of all the good things
[00:50.97]想起了我們
[00:54.58]That we have left undone
[00:54.58]還未完成的心願
[00:59.25]And I suffer premonitions
[00:59.25]令我痛苦的猜測
[01:03.57]Confirm suspicions
[01:03.57]最終預示了
[01:07.65]Of the holocaust to come
[01:07.65]大屠殺即將來臨
[01:20.77]The rusty wire that holds the cork
[01:20.77]銹跡斑斑的鐵絲
[01:24.24]That keeps the anger in
[01:24.24]是憤怒閥門的最後防線
[01:31.56]Gives way
[01:31.56]鬆開了
[01:32.74]And suddenly its day again
[01:32.74]突然之間天亮了
[01:41.15]The sun is in the east
[01:41.15]一天本已結束
[01:44.46]Even though the day is done
[01:44.46]太陽仍在東方
[01:49.75]Two suns in the sunset
[01:49.75]兩個太陽的日落
[01:57.38]Could be the human race is run
[01:57.38]也許就是人類的最終結局
[02:19.48]Like the moment when your brakes lock
[02:19.48]當制動器緊閉的那一刻
[02:23.01]And you slide toward the big truck
[02:23.01]然後你滑向一輛大貨車
[02:25.99]And stretch the frozen moments with your fear
[02:25.99]你与恐懼凍結在那一瞬間
[02:33.66]And you'll never hear their voices
[02:33.66]你從未聽到他們的尖叫
[02:37.22]And you'll never see their faces
[02:37.22]你從未見過他們的面孔
[02:40.76]You have no recourse to the law anymore
[02:40.76]你再也沒有法律的庇護
[03:02.55]And as the windshield melts
[03:02.55]當擋風玻璃融化
[03:05.63]My tears evaporate
[03:05.63]我的眼淚已經蒸發
[03:12.71]Leaving only charcoal to defend
[03:12.71]守護的一切都变成了木炭
[03:23.26]Finally I understand
[03:23.26]最終我明白了
[03:26.16]The feelings of the few
[03:26.16]那些人的感受
[03:31.92]As he's and diamonds
[03:31.92]鑽石與灰燼
[03:35.75]Foe and friend
[03:35.75]朋友與敵人
[03:38.89]We were all equal in the end
[03:38.89]我們的結局都一樣
